        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9. [https://www.submarinenetworks.com/en/systems/euro-africa/mainone](https://www.submarinenetworks.com/en/systems/euro-africa/mainone)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
